@G01A.integral_remainder : ∀ {K L : ℝ} (J : CAS07M05.JacobiPremises K L),
  ∀ s ∈ Set.Icc 0 L, J.D s = s • ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ Cas07M04.Plane - ∫ (t : ℝ) in 0..s, (s - t) • J.R t ∘SL J.D t
'G01A.integral_remainder' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
