'G01A.det_matrixOf' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
G01A.det_conj : ∀ (O : Cas07M04.Plane ≃ₗᵢ[ℝ] Cas07M04.Plane) (A : Cas07M04.Op),
